  <item>
    <title>Vol.133 从童话小镇到瑞士湖边｜欧洲行（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae5274097726cd4675a64e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae5274097726cd4675a64e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>下雨的科尔马</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FphPdqYT9D1yNtApIu8w6ab-n19H.jpg"><p><span>大家可以想到《哈尔的移动城堡》吗？</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvQtNEfDvsTSy8YlzlwdjfUTdBa.jpg"><p><span>科尔马住的商务酒店，喜欢这样的设计</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqHc15NefmCiuksKtIYoQ8Ytf7Zv.jpg"><p><span>背景墙上的人物便是艾弗尔铁塔的设计师</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fot9I1U5wxNLf69M7bBdR3LPeU4W.jpg"><p><span>为什么是香港时间</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftk4ui1UOk6UFUH1cy8dPx8Ow5bi.jpg"><p><span>餐厅区域</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikqzmpJMDhq6RTUQVK-Fz1gcbmR.jpg"><p><span>免费的早餐</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAM7CyKJXBVh7cjiIdf0UAwOjac.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfrCVXnDGNMNrKoxpW36yF3mRyI.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhh4fqO2ekBgA4N2NKKfypf4Hic3.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnleLVOsyAgEuyjRr4qLbSGkVJk2.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOt6vYoCO7DNc8J9Rsup1k4PGnd.jpg"><p><span>因为一直下雨，所以逛科尔马的心情大打折扣</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYpjUVFRv7klWuoMoabR6iFF-W8.jpg"><p><span>在雨中还在坚持摆摊的旧物市场摊主</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjviZ3ilKjuchroJgKK81U1gu3-R.jpg"><p><span>科尔马的一家书店</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9-TpcYJkopGomCUVteZ6wuGnq0.jpg"><p><span>很《哈尔的移动城堡》了</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_JQxaArllAZMNeATxIKq0KHlqs.jpg"><p><span>菜市场干干净净，但是东西很少，爱赶集的人表示很失望</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgqJEVSEzK0rO-dp62TR-eZ3H6yb.jpg"><p><span>时常可以在这里看到坐小船的游客，因为桥很小很矮，过桥的时候游客要平躺才行。哈哈哈</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhaBKZq2b43gP_KfSnWqnL_wp8oP.jpg"><p><span>感觉自己就是苏菲</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fin7rddowHcBl-YnerBYQ4j0cNPj.jpg"><p><span>满地都是的自由女神标识</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnylqn0JgpI2GQtNisBhrcU3spPm.jpg"><p><span>竟然吃到了popeye，发发最高！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIvXCu2kNovSaU8pxjsEM--0bY5.jpg"><p><span>我喜欢的瑞士巧克力</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWTevc4ykvRV_DssftO5HnK7HK0.jpg"><p><span>日内瓦湖上赫然一个大叉子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjMJVR4zEEkA1rkA7FnJ54IK-Gn.jpg"><p><span>依然是我爱的集市</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1W4KZGuBVW2bCofx1rWaoFXXb4.jpg"><p><span>瑞士人真的没有班味</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FouCx4OfB7dJJ5qsTT0bMsoBFhO5.jpg"><p><span>星星狗和可爱的冰淇淋小摊</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh5KSUDoEZvXvS4Nr0S4bqm6Nx2a.jpg"><p><span>第一次见到这种像“飞边子”一样的芝士。星星说“锅贴没吃过，买！”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulMfWuSe-Eux6vE1Qn6a_FRvGQu.jpg"><p><span>特别nice的菜摊主</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgCaT-JR8VnjFG3HRsjTjfDOom1L.jpg"><p><span>享受生活还是得看瑞士人</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOUizkeIpZFC81qWabVDG672N4X.jpg"><p><span>正宗瑞士菜</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_J-mLcItNb9SrNp9k_u82t2qPQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUQKCpOt6WMh-ZFx9lc00ScezII.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5JZUgHLrfEm2EVaaQmZ46xlGx4.jpg"><p><span>给大家做的草莓蛋糕</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQEAv0u_lswtEfUxNTj3g9ueWEx.jpg"><p><span>在瑞士最后一晚的日落</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvs1sIvlZK0oZ2hOPUPWt69IRPkv.jpg"><p><span>回家后给阿里展示给他买的所有糖果和巧克力</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3moHX5Q06yMqPkIv6S5ROJSi2V.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/661b78945e98ac727499fba2/loIC8QbLCe7qXArq7NXVVzZ9GUwq.m4a" length="78612480" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQDhL8WDk0UvoXujQBH5Wkg9Kvm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.132 有被温暖，也有被冒犯｜欧洲行（中）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adc086197726cd46756cdc4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adc086197726cd46756cdc4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>星星狗</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj3QOfGBmY4_-diGKSZcmQ9pmIed.jpg"><p></p><p><span>斯特拉斯堡的餐厅菜单</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv06a1TF5it1r5ehuwVp_mUXShPu.jpg"><p><span>蜗牛</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fla0Re2bpFjaizyc-e4zRI7Nf6ha.jpg"><p><span>鸭肝</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhY1O0eJZGJ0esxF0jyJThsK8Sdz.jpg"><p><span>三种鱼块+酸菜山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fre5bB_Dd4arNpdMWuJEYEw2QOnT.jpg"><p><span>餐厅远景</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNbNGKiK2XdRnkfNj6bLQCI2qQQ.jpg"><p><span>喜欢的一条小路</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftssgf4peY4ItRX2NUKtaPPu2mdP.jpg"><p><span>教堂白天的样子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrfWTHPOLwJAbWUs84XPDK3xgXO.jpg"><p><span>教堂内部细节图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpxk38JQ7TKdguaQe4p7yv7TrU2r.jpg"><p><span>斯特拉斯堡的独特木质结构建筑</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAa1VX_pKsvIqg5XDoQf-PMqO7Z.jpg"><p><span>中国产的土特羊毛袜</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKxCAwP-gfiywrkrrRywQ3fIBP9.jpg"><p><span>好吃的马卡龙店</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqEuEzCWnXhqfoh94O3kU39eyc1S.jpg"><p><span>马卡龙店外观</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTkHLHu8eKQd9DkfoVAvhRbagGb.jpg"><p><span>和发发的饭后小点心</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrFs_a5_jc9ekD6VyshB_x3ljYG.jpg"><p><span>斯特拉斯堡好适合约会</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpbPwQUWESerERPBMy-PDKmfpD08.jpg"><p><span>我们坐的游览船</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnl6W-OVpSlvjGLNDurCCuJ_4eGY.jpg"><p><span>教堂晚间的样子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQj0usq-nK2MbCg0EEtPnRunTvS.jpg"><p><span>斧子餐厅餐牌</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzaA1xhbivhjggqHFl4A4pNxs_6.jpg"><p><span>发发一眼相中的灯</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgUDeKA8cJpQP1Yt8eBBbUVP81tN.jpg"><p><span>牛蛙腿和烤章鱼，48欧是不是很划算！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvGydLifvrFa9eE9Pihr7beiujh.jpg"><p><span>巴巴爸爸</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjpIvAXUbvVD4G4XkGLOcWL1g9l0.jpg"><p><span>我们住的酒店外观</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljAnSlzEdW4lw6KPZby5hNXudJU.jpg"><p><span>吃到头发的早餐店</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnxp2XcI9JnOCyEKTZPMRBSkWduq.jpg"><p><span>吃到头发的芝士挞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEJHhc2f9sV1tNH01CvmCh5gG02.jpg"><p><span>斯特拉斯堡真的好漂亮</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNhrph7jzqZOZ7i1t75YhKF9jvu.jpg"><p><span>在跳蚤市场看到了一本貌似是讲中国生肖的旧书</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpaTfOR4Zzz-N4dkMwxm_i2zG73Y.jpg"><p><span>闪电泡芙</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPLiVO8qsQ_GbkNyb4jyccAswFN.jpg"><p><span>新鲜出炉的玛德琳小蛋糕</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fil_Zh35avAkSvj6TSrEwzUKNpZd.jpg"><p><span>不知道怎么读的早餐店</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgYJ-id3Hz9nyMb_K-83NJSRQxRA.jpg"><p><span>斯特拉斯堡的独特建筑</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuoOFVd4wGDtpE7Yyt1pKuThI-0.jpg"><p><span>又是被艺术熏陶的一天</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmgd4wPj1eJSOm21vnyZ8CEijlsg.jpg"><p><span>吃生鱼饭的餐厅内部</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbkMq9fInhP9CUOo9gwudiit4ge.jpg"><p><span>这么大一碗不到20欧</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjsh0ilhgoLx3ATDhL4KTcuPdTyw.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/661b78945e98ac727499fba2/lt6mMp602XMAb8ezemywune2swiM.m4a" length="64770424" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8cg_M3R3vw5-3-isT_j9PmKBFp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.131 “抛夫弃子”去德国，投奔我的互联网姐妹｜欧洲行（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad0486ee742e36efcc338d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad0486ee742e36efcc338d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>抛下老公和孩子在家，锅贴一个人去欧洲投奔发发发。这一期主要是讲在德国的旅行部分，内容有点长，希望不会影响大家的听感。</span></p><p><span>歹毒飞机餐</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrNyeJqNJLmrsXL9P7l1mtALEQn7.jpg"><p><span>德铁</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqPrDV5WVwhkblsdm3f09CsnORlQ.jpg"><p><span>德国“小”肘子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHA9RSw4ldwwRvkJs-mEVMIWULx.jpg"><p><span>不是广告</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnbYUCdf8WrGczyzqcz3LbyUcey.jpg"><p><span>不是广告</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnq7S7v_wsHamQ-SYIR3NkZ4t6r2.jpg"><p><span>红色灯笼果</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo_0IhXr2wpxzsXJTf2hWUqYH2G_.jpg"><p><span>罗马广场的室内菜市场</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0bRXZbTmwhvw8tftJAMi9wQUse.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg4PxuTIPpZxPXhcsuvk-8dc-AQ6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmhv37w3QlL2ZqFjYIWuyi3enYAP.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu91wmGtyuat6Z92vuvCpWttolBc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgpsY4YouR5F0CKBDYfh5z9_dK7K.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liOaRPhaSe8tiqo8WApUaxmttOaf.jpg"><p><span>倔强老头咖啡店</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpENEv3LfTdCJuZqOHsIt6v9KZ-E.jpg"><p><span>碱水结早餐</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lofA2LiGO5DqilkCGLPdrST3kOnm.jpg"><p><span>发发发为我准备了书籍和水果</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqUrrAakivmZ2F5hesca70U_Guc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgKfGWwFNlpg08S-7SOLVDbqYMMa.jpg"><p><span>缆车风景</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsoXFkPISaESlG7dC7Ej0Z-a_y2L.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpnWB__8YVfXufmx5xt5_iNDegbs.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk4yrTigRU-KtL--Kg2GkqDaYid6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnDv3YI2NldQ5-vnXb-q4P9NC_fH.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpOmU6w4hNfJ06oEO5mBEQyPfkyl.jpg"><p><span>大酒桶</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq-TxzBIC3zFoDpI-d5DfnxrePvf.jpg"><p><span>大药房博物馆</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZaiOFbEz1z-Mvnmr96H7mwHv02.jpg"><p><span>达姆的五指婚礼教堂</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeZE6vo9jFEoA3m0f0k19Z6bgrC.jpg"><p><span>有人在玩“门球”的林荫小路</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lu1rNIAGYkB5xwHay5_4IaA1Zkc4.jpg"><p><span>“小人之心”火腿</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgQc1UENOITmnBJ7465v2BXm3BE5.jpg"><p><span>科隆大教堂</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk3G37No_XGC2DnjLo4mbBBiigBF.jpg"><p><span>发发发给我买的红色灯笼果冰淇淋</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOxDdpmm1sNBMF_n6Aj_dtSa4yM.jpg"><p><span>干烧鱼和锅包肉外卖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnpw2_EEqs2YK-72zAlDaUc6BNdC.jpg"><p><span>德国生猪肉三明治</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FolDf17Uc-BJ60WWdFMDAiWPIuZH.jpg"><p><span>格林兄弟的故乡</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrkP-FvrnfS8yvK7PLGyxHWRVfS2.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0xLbQmlfvAWpieGAwILYzt_ZV0.jpg"><p><span>德国老头让我去马路对面拍摄的小教堂</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsoTIALex5aqljvpk5uPptF8NPFB.jpg"><p><span>羽毛白</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuw1KJWnKY9kaAyNYbfE8okX5_PO.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
